; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) — draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid
; Publish at the DNS host. A file on the website cannot satisfy the scanner.
;
; Nameservers today: dns1.registrar-servers.com (Namecheap BasicDNS).
;
; Namecheap: Domain List → Manage → Advanced DNS → Add New Record
;   Type HTTPS | Host _index._agents | Value 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port | TTL 3600
; Repeat for _mcp._agents, _a2a._agents, and the .www hosts below.
; Also add the TXT records. Then enable DNSSEC.
;
; If HTTPS is missing from the Type dropdown, use Cloudflare DNS (free),
; DNS-only / grey cloud, Type HTTPS or SVCB, then enable DNSSEC.

; Scanner queries HTTPS and SVCB at _index._agents, _mcp._agents, _a2a._agents
; for both www.masukusafaris.com and masukusafaris.com.
_index._agents.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_mcp._agents.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_a2a._agents.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_index._agents.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN TXT "v=dnsaid1;alpn=h2,h3;port=443;target=masukusafaris.com;mcp=https://masukusafaris.com/api/mcp;cap=https://masukusafaris.com/.well-known/agent-index.json"
_index._agents.www.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_mcp._agents.www.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_a2a._agents.www.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_index._agents.www.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN TXT "v=dnsaid1;alpn=h2,h3;port=443;target=masukusafaris.com;mcp=https://masukusafaris.com/api/mcp;cap=https://masukusafaris.com/.well-known/agent-index.json"

; HTTP index: https://masukusafaris.com/.well-known/agent-index.json
; MCP: https://masukusafaris.com/api/mcp

